<details class="panel narrow">
    <summary>Password not being saved?</summary>
    <p>Your browser controls password saving. Check that its password manager offers to save passwords and that this address is not excluded.</p>
    <p>In Chrome, enable “Offer to save passwords” in Google Password Manager settings. In Safari on Mac, enable “User names and passwords” in AutoFill settings. You can also add your Xur address and account directly in your password manager.</p>
    <p>Browsers may disable saving when you bypass a certificate warning. Use Xur’s Tailscale HTTPS address or a certificate trusted by your browser.</p>
</details>
